 disable camera movement/head bob.FOV slider: you can now adjust your field of view.Balance ChangesMemento Ring: reworked. Entering critical health now grants 15 seconds of invulnerability.Bug FixesFixed a bug where inventory could load incorrectly. Thanks again for the 500+ wishlists! More changes are on the way.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:52:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028240","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:35:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3998220-1847286114027261","game_id":"steam-3998220","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix Demo 1.0.3","summary":"Fixed a bug where inventory could load incorrectly under certain conditions. We just crossed 500 wishlists in a day, thank you so much for the support, it genuinely means a lot. More fixes and improvements are on the way.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T01:49:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027261","verified_at":"2026-10-21T03:14:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3998220-1844115010493456","game_id":"steam-3998220","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is coming!","summary":"Hope Falls will be part of Steam Next Fest, running October 19 – October 26, starting at 10 AM.Try the demo, explore the world, and let us know what you think!👉 https://store.steampowered.com/sale/nextfest","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T23:17:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493456","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3998220-1824459501605065","game_id":"steam-3998220","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to HOPE FALLS","summary":"Hello, and welcome to our first dev log! When we started this project two years ago, we felt the action survival genre had begun to feel too... familiar. Many games were built on the same foundations. Some did a few things brilliantly but struggled elsewhere. Others lowered the barrier so much that the experience became forgettable.Many survival games are either deeply hardcore, demanding dozens of hours just to feel competent, or they are lightweight experiences that do not leave much of a mark","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-11T23:39:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824459501605065","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3998220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-22T03:52:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-22T03:52:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3998220":"2026-10-22T03:52:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3998220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-22T03:52:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-22T03:52:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5357340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-22T03:52:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-22T03:52:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
